sequenceDiagram
    participant R as 读操作
    participant L as Lock CF
    participant W as Write CF
    participant D as Default CF

    R->>L: 检查 key 是否有 lock.start_ts <= read_start_ts 的锁
    alt 有未提交的锁
        L-->>R: 等待 or 触发冲突解决
    else 无锁
        L-->>R: 通过
        R->>W: Seek(key, read_start_ts)，找 commit_ts <= read_start_ts 的最新记录
        W-->>R: WriteRecord { start_ts, write_type }
        R->>D: Get(key, start_ts)
        D-->>R: value
    end
